OL,10,G0000 Eras: Spice Girls
OL,11,     F1/4. Rosie Ramsey follows the
OL,12,     FSpice Girls as they take their
OL,13,     Ffirst steps toward superstardom.
OL,14,     FCue sisterhood, subterfuge, and a
OL,15,     Ftotal refusal to do anything but
OL,16,     Fwin.
