OL,5,G0100 Eras: Spice Girls
OL,6,     F3/4. Rosie Ramsey follows the
OL,7,     FSpice Girls as they enter an
OL,8,     Funcertain new era. Tabloids
OL,9,     Fabound, a backlash brews, and five
OL,10,     Fbecome four. Friendship never
OL,11,     Fends. Or does it?
OL,12,G0130 Eras: Spice Girls
OL,13,     F4/4. Rosie Ramsey is your guide to
OL,14,     Flife after Spice. From
OL,15,     Fchart-topping solo careers to
OL,16,     Freinvention, reconciliation and
OL,17,     Fthe occasional reunion, this
OL,18,     Fstory's far from over.
